  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "GORDO took his party series TARAKA to a new level this year, turning the party concept into a six-week residency at Pacha in Ibiza. His opening night featured an all-female supporting line-up, while the rest of the residency brought in marquee names such as Nicole Moudaber, Vintage Culture, Patrick Topping and HoneyLuv. GORDO’s touring schedule included stops at high-profile festivals including Coachella and Tomorrowland, as well as dates across the Americas. On the production side, he expanded his house-driven palette with ‘Loco Loco’, a collaboration with Reinier Zonneveld, and ‘ENERGY’ with WhoMadeWho.",
